<section class="content" id="activities">

<h3>Practical Activities</h3>

<h4>A. Truthfulness Audit</h4>
<p>For the next three days, keep a small journal where you note every time you told a lie, a half-truth, exaggerated, or omitted something important that should have been said. Be honest &mdash;this is just for you. At the end, reflect: What patterns do you notice? What situations tempt you most to be untruthful? Write your observations:</p>
