<h4>B. Letter of Reparation</h4>
<p>Is there someone you have harmed with your words &mdash;through a lie, gossip, rash judgment, or calumny? Write them a letter (you don't have to send it, but you may). Acknowledge the specific harm you caused. Ask for their forgiveness. If the harm is serious and you can repair it without causing greater harm, make a plan to do so. Write the letter here or in your notebook:</p>
