<h4>C. Media Fast &amp; Truth Reflection</h4>
<p>Choose one 24-hour period this week to abstain from social media and news. During that time, notice: How much of what you normally consume is truthful, verified, and constructive? How much is gossip, speculation, or outrage-driven content? At the end, write a short reflection: What would a Christian approach to media consumption look like?</p>
<p style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);margin-bottom:8px">&nbsp;</p>
