<section class="content">

<h3>Prayer for This Week</h3>

<blockquote>
<p>Lord Jesus, you who are the Way, the Truth, and the Life,<br />
make my heart a home for truth.<br />
Free me from the lies I tell myself,<br />
from the half-truths that preserve my comfort,<br />
from the words that wound another's good name.<br />
Give me courage to speak the truth with love,<br />
wisdom to know when to speak and when to be silent,<br />
and humility to repair the harm my words have caused.<br />
Holy Spirit, Spirit of Truth, dwell in me<br />
that I may be a faithful witness<br />
and not a false one.<br />
St. Thomas More, pray for us.<br />
Amen.</p>
</blockquote>

